  "remaining": [
    "Exactly six original analytic hypotheses and literal iid Exp(1) stopped recursion. Fixed y,xRef,z0 and deterministic event depth n; arbitrary fixed Borel finite-valued absolute horizon b may be unbounded across histories. U reads the actual next record. Strict live event a(Hn)<U<b(Hn) equals the positive relative-cap event. Borel absolute density, every-history fiber mass<=1, guarded actual clock/whole-history append, exact actual restricted joint/marginal laws and all joint ENNReal tests on every old-history event (including null ones) are derived internally. Stopped time0, raw negative flow and T+max(u-T,0) off-support append are auxiliary only. No normalization, integrability, finite-wait, no-atom, survival or coordinate/provider premise. Existing actual-input a.s. nonaccumulation78 and half-open coverage79 are retained and not reproved. Only one coordinate edge within S87-I5/G86-11 is targeted. Finite ordered iteration, final88 survival/hazard assembly, endpoint resolution when used, actual count/prescribed path identification, A7 summability/fullA7, physical-time residual restart/Markov, invariance/semigroup/L2/hypocoercivity, implementation/errors/unbounded costs/main/composition/full papers/Goal remain OPEN.",
